# Proprietary Control4 FPGA bitstream — NOT in the repo. The owner of the
# hardware already has it (see board/ioxv1/firmware/fpga/README.md). Drop
# iox-fpga.bin in this directory to bake it into the image; it stays untracked.
# This .gitignore keeps the directory itself present so /lib/firmware/c4 exists
# in the built rootfs and the loader (S12fpga) has somewhere to find the file.
*
!.gitignore
